direction: down
"derived-credit": "derived-credit\nThe source claim clears pending before vector fetch;\na later publication belongs to a new claim epoch"
"native-target": "native-target\nSelect VM0 processor0 at native callback acceptance\nunder lifecycle lease; no kernel-origin generation\ninference"
"vector-fetch": "vector-fetch\nFetch vector after claim; root selected procedure;\nlater replacement does not rewrite that reference"
"storage-commit": "storage-commit\nPending and active target-bound work retain old VM;\nroot lease and native retirement receipts required"
"mailbox": "mailbox\nMailbox is wake hint; authoritative target/claim-\nepoch pending state survives drain; never merge\nacross claim"
"thread-route": "thread-route\nCurrent thread invokes directly; absent current\nthread queues primordial thunk; preserve terminated-\ntarget exceptions"
"dynamic-handler": "dynamic-handler\nRead dynamic user handler when thunk executes;\ncustom vector procedures and exceptions require\nseparate semantic refinement"
"deferred-user": "deferred-user\nDeferred-user pending bit and setter-filter replay\nare separate from native pending; clear before\ncalling supplied procedure"
"native-target" -> "derived-credit"
"derived-credit" -> "mailbox"
"derived-credit" -> "vector-fetch"
"vector-fetch" -> "thread-route"
"thread-route" -> "dynamic-handler"
"dynamic-handler" -> "deferred-user"
"native-target" -> "storage-commit"
"mailbox" -> "storage-commit"
"thread-route" -> "storage-commit"
"deferred-user" -> "storage-commit"
proof: "SysML -> ASCENT -> QNT / Lean; source + platform OPEN"
"storage-commit" -> proof
gain0: "coalescing\nCompared with current flag path no callback-count\nsaving is established; merging across claim is\nforbidden"
proof -> gain0
gain1: "wake\nOnly wake hints merge; no SIGINT delivery or user\ncallback may be inferred completed from exchange"
proof -> gain1
gain2: "retirement\nOld VM must remain serviceable until accepted work and\nroots settle; no bounded shutdown guarantee"
proof -> gain2
gain3: "language\nZig does not remove these semantic obligations;\nadditional language benefit remains unproved"
proof -> gain3
